OL,6, Forty seven children aged between eight
OL,7, and 12 were rescued as flames swept
OL,8, through a hotel in Westminster.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FAn 11-year-old boy broke an arm when he
OL,11,Fjumped from the fourth floor and landed
OL,12,Fon the roof of a first-floor extension.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FTwo other children were brought down by
OL,15,Ffiremen with ladders.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FTwo children and six adults, including
OL,18,Fa firemen, were taken to hospital for
OL,19,Ftreatment.
OL,20,F
OL,21,FThe children were from Beck School in
OL,22,FSheffield.
OL,23,F                     D]CFromG14-03-82
