OL,6, Fire has damaged several laboratories
OL,7, in the medical school at Southampton
OL,8, University.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FA university spokesman said the blaze
OL,11,Fhad put back important research into
OL,12,Fhuman diseases several years.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FFiremen had to wear breathing equipment
OL,15,Fbecause of toxic fumes from burning
OL,16,Fchemicals.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThe cause of the fire is not known.
OL,19,F
OL,20,F
OL,21,F
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFromG14-03-82C/ teletextarchive.com
