OL,6, The Times was still waiting for editor
OL,7, Mr Harold Evans to resign last night,
OL,8, amid rumours that he had been offered
OL,9, a golden handshake.
OL,10,F
OL,11,FThe 11-man board of journalists, which
OL,12,Fclaims to represent 80 per cent of the
OL,13,Fpaper's writers, said there was concern
OL,14,Fthat the "gradual erosion of editorial
OL,15,Fstandards" might mean there was soon
OL,16,Fno paper left worth saving.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FA spokesman for Mr Rupert Murdoch
OL,19,Fsaid it was still expected Mr Evans
OL,20,Fwould resign by tomorrow.
OL,21,F
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFromG14-03-82C/ teletextarchive.com
