OL,6, Up to 45 people were reported killed
OL,7, in a guerrilla ambush on a military and
OL,8, civilian convoy in El Salvador.
OL,9,B
OL,10,BAbout 50 civilians and 84 soldiers were
OL,11,Btravelling to the provincial capital in
OL,12,Bthe north of the country when the
OL,13,Bguerrillas attacked.
OL,14,B
OL,15,BIn a four-hour battle, guerrillas fired
OL,16,Bgrenades and anti-tank guns at the last
OL,17,Bthree trucks in the convoy.
OL,18,B
OL,19,BThe battle ended when army helicopters
OL,20,Bbrought in reinforcements.
OL,21,B
OL,22,B
OL,23,T]CFromG14-03-82C/ teletextarchive.com
