OL,6, Mr Roy Jenkins is in for a crippling
OL,7, defeat in the Glasgow Hillhead by-
OL,8, election, according to an opinion poll.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe survey, published in today's
OL,11,FObserver, shows him running a poor
OL,12,Fthird behind Labour and Conservative
OL,13,Fcandidates.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FFavourite to win is the Labour man,
OL,16,FMr David Wiseman, with 33 per cent of
OL,17,Fthe electorate behind him.
OL,18,F
OL,19,S/FA second poll for the Sunday Standard
OL,20,Fand BBC Scotland gives the Tories a 3
OL,21,Fper cent lead, with Labour and the SDP
OL,22,Fneck and neck.
OL,23,                      D]CFromG14-03-82
